<title>USA: NYS  Environmental Corp repriced/restructured.</title>
<headline>NYS  Environmental Corp repriced/restructured.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co. said Tuesday it repriced New York State Environmental Facilities Corporation $115 million deal, raising yields in several maturities, also eliminating the 2014 maturity.</p>
<p>The repricing/restructure follows:</p>
<p>NEW YORK STATE ENVIRONMENTAL FACILITIES CORPORATIORE:</p>
<p>$114,645,000*</p>
<p>STATE WATER POLLUTION CONTROL REVOLVING</p>
<p>FUND REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1997 D</p>
<p>NEW YORK CITY MUNICIPAL WATER FINANCE</p>
<p>AUTHORITY PROJECT</p>
<p>(SECOND RESOLUTION BONDS)</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT WILL BE CLOSED.</p>
